      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display text-ink font-normal m-0">
          The Living Palette: Crushed Minerals & Pure Gold
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted font-serif leading-relaxed m-0">
          Unlike modern synthetic colors, the traditional palette of the Jonang arts tradition relies exclusively on pulverized mountain minerals bound with purified organic hide glue:
        </p>

        <div class="surface-card overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm font-serif">
            <thead class="bg-surface-subtle border-b border-border text-ink font-bold">
